# chrysalis project manifest — `.ys` files under this directory run against the
# `spatio-flux` package (its native FBA / diffusion / particle processes), via
# the codegen path: `chrysalis run` generates + builds + caches a runner crate
# linking this package. The crate must expose
# `spatio_flux::prelude::{registry, methods, modules}` (the codegen convention).
package spatio-flux
